{"t":"Snow Heap","s":"snow-heap-12eae","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Snow_Heap_7e321b.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Snow Heap</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Snow Heap\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Snow_Heap_7e321b.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Living and Dead<br/>Natural Products</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"immobile\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Movable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"mapcolor\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Map Color</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #999999; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"></span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6.5<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 19, 2001</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20181224145656&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Snow_Heap_7e321b.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a snow heap.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Vega\">Vega</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Percht%20Island\">Percht Island</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Use it to obtain a <a href=\"#/wiki/Snowball\">Snowball</a>. This can be repeated an unlimited amount of times.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>Snow Heaps were implemented with Update 6.5 when they were temporarily added to cities such as <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin\">Carlin</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a> as part of Christmas 2001. Due to players <i>heavily misusing <a href=\"#/wiki/Snowball\">snowballs</a> for powergaming</i>, this event was not repeated the following Christmas.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"w-cite_ref-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></sup>\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-center wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"67f0ff42ceb67c908429a862707bc160\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:302px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:217px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Snow_Heaps_in_Edron-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:183px; width:300px; top:16px;\"><img alt=\"Snow Heaps in Edron for Christmas 2001\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Snow Heaps in Edron for Christmas 2001\" height=\"215\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Snow_Heaps_in_Edron_32c27e.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"Snow Heaps in Edron.jpg (253 KB)\" width=\"300\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:300px;\">Snow Heaps in Edron for Christmas 2001</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:302px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:217px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Snow_Heaps_in_Carlin-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:215px; width:300px;\"><img alt=\"And in Carlin\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"And in Carlin\" height=\"215\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Snow_Heaps_in_Carlin_c6a365.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Snow Heaps in Carlin.png (934 KB)\" width=\"300\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:300px;\">And in Carlin</div></div></div>\n<p>Later on, a couple of these heaps was permanently added next to Santa's House in <a href=\"#/wiki/Vega\">Vega</a>, however they cannot be reached. Only with the implementation of the <a href=\"#/quest/winterlight-solstice\">Winterlight Solstice</a> event with Update 12.02, Snow Heaps were added to reachable locations again.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"w-cite_note-1\"><b>^</b> <span class=\"reference-text\">Christmas Update 2002</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li>Living and Dead</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Snowball\">Snowball</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/winterlight-solstice\">Winterlight Solstice</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["winterlight-solstice"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"winterlight-solstice","quest":"Winterlight Solstice","step":"1-2","n":6,"title":"Fazer uma bola de neve grande","kind":"mention","coords":[]}]}}